+*   **Transmittance:** $T(\vec{x}_a, \vec{x}_b) = e^{-\tau(\vec{x}_a, \vec{x}_b)}$, where $\tau(\vec{x}_a, \vec{x}_b) = \int_{\vec{x}_a}^{\vec{x}_b} \sigma_t(\vec{x}) d\vec{x}$ and $\sigma_t = \sigma_a + \sigma_s$ [S2].
