+*   **Fractional Visibility:** $V(\vec{x}', \vec{\omega}) = \int_{4\pi} T(\vec{x}', \vec{x}_{0,i}) \Phi_\theta(\vec{\omega}, \vec{\omega}_i) d\vec{\omega}_i$, where $\vec{x}_{0,i}$ is the point where the ray leaves the volume [S2].
 
