-    *   Compute contribution: $C_{contrib} = C_{sample} \cdot L_a \cdot V_{prev}$.
-    *   Blend front-to-back into `eye_current`:
-        $$
-        C_{out} = C_{in} + C_{contrib} \cdot \alpha_{sample} \cdot (1 - \alpha_{in})
-        $$
